---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: about/certifications/index.html
title: 산업재산권 및 인증
description: 주식회사 하이탑이 보유한 신축이음장치 분야 등록 특허와 조달·기업 관련 공식 인증 내역입니다.
bodyClass: bg-surface text-ink
---

{% set visibleCerts = company.certifications | rejectattr("hold") %}

<section class="relative mt-20 h-[36vh] min-h-[280px] max-h-[380px] overflow-hidden bg-night">
  <img src="{{ '/images/hero/about-hero.webp' | url }}" alt="교량 구조와 기반시설을 표현한 이미지"
       class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_54%]" width="1672" height="941" fetchpriority="high">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-night/45"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-44 bg-gradient-to-t from-night/75 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="container-hi relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-end pb-9 text-white sm:pb-11">
    <nav aria-label="브레드크럼" class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-white/60">
      <a href="{{ '/' | url }}" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">홈</a>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">chevron_right</span>
      <a href="{{ '/about/' | url }}" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">회사소개</a>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">chevron_right</span>
      <span aria-current="page" class="text-white/90">산업재산권 및 인증</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="eyebrow-line !text-white/60">Patents &amp; Certifications</span>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white [text-shadow:0_2px_18px_rgba(11,14,19,0.45)] sm:text-4xl">산업재산권 및 인증</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container-hi">
  <nav class="cert-index" aria-label="문서 바로가기">
    <a href="#patents">등록 특허 <span>{{ company.patents | length }}</span></a>
    <a href="#certifications">공식 인증 <span>{{ visibleCerts | length }}</span></a>
    <p>문서를 선택하면 크게 볼 수 있습니다.</p>
  </nav>
</div>

<section id="patents" class="cert-section container-hi">
  <header class="cert-section-heading">
    <h2>등록 특허 <span>{{ company.patents | length }}</span></h2>
    <p>신축이음장치·인도교 분야의 등록 특허</p>
  </header>
  <div class="cert-grid">
    {% for p in company.patents %}
      <figure class="cert-item">
        <a href="{{ ('/images/certs/' ~ p.img ~ '.jpg') | url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cert-preview" aria-label="특허증 제{{ p.no }}호 크게 보기">
          <img src="{{ ('/images/certs/' ~ p.img ~ '-sm.jpg') | url }}" alt="특허증 제{{ p.no }}호 {{ p.title }}" width="311" height="440" loading="lazy">
        </a>
        <figcaption class="cert-caption">
          <p class="cert-meta">{{ p.year }} · 등록 특허</p>
          <h3>{{ p.title }}</h3>
          <p class="cert-number">제{{ p.no }}호</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section id="certifications" class="cert-section container-hi">
  <header class="cert-section-heading">
    <h2>공식 인증 <span>{{ visibleCerts | length }}</span></h2>
    <p>기업 자격 및 직접생산 확인 자료</p>
  </header>
  <div class="cert-grid">
    {% for c in visibleCerts %}
      <article class="cert-item">
        {% if c.img %}
          <a href="{{ ('/images/certs/' ~ c.img ~ '.jpg') | url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cert-preview" aria-label="{{ c.name }} 크게 보기">
            <img src="{{ ('/images/certs/' ~ c.img ~ '-sm.jpg') | url }}" alt="{{ c.name }}" width="311" height="440" loading="lazy">
          </a>
        {% else %}
          <div class="cert-preview"><p>인증서 이미지 준비 중</p></div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="cert-caption">
          <h3>{{ c.name }}</h3>
          <p class="cert-meta">{{ c.issuer }}</p>
          <p class="cert-number">{{ c.period }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="mt-8 border-t border-line pt-5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-secondary">게시된 문서는 주소를 가린 공개용 사본입니다. 원본 확인이 필요하시면 문의해 주시기 바랍니다.</p>
</section>

{% set ctaTitle = "인증 사본이나 시험성적서가 필요하신가요?" %}
{% set ctaDesc = "공공조달 제출용 서류는 요청 주시면 안내해 드립니다." %}
{% set ctaSecondary = { label: "연혁 보기", url: "/about/history/" } %}
{% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
